#: giveaways.py:642
msgid "Giveaway Advanced — Required Arguments"
msgstr "Sorteo avanzado — Opciones obligatorias"

#: giveaways.py:643
msgid ""
"**NOTE:** Giveaways are checked every 15 seconds, so they may end slightly later than specified.\n"
"\n"
"**Required arguments:**\n"
"`--prize` / `-p`: The prize to be won.\n"
"\n"
"**Duration (one required):**\n"
"`--duration` / `-d`: Duration like `2d3h30m`.\n"
"`--end` / `-e`: End time like `tomorrow at 3am`, `2024-12-25T00:00:00Z`.\n"
"\n"
"**Optional:**\n"
"`--channel`: The channel to post in (defaults to current).\n"
"`--emoji`: Custom emoji for the giveaway.\n"
"`--winners`: Number of winners to draw.\n"
"`--description`: Description shown on the embed.\n"
"`--hosted-by`: Override the host user."
msgstr ""
"**NOTA:** los sorteos se revisan cada 15 segundos, así que pueden terminar un poco más tarde de lo indicado.\n"
"\n"
"**Opciones obligatorias:**\n"
"`--prize` / `-p`: el premio.\n"
"\n"
"**Duración (una de las dos):**\n"
"`--duration` / `-d`: duración como `2d3h30m`.\n"
"`--end` / `-e`: hora de fin como `tomorrow at 3am`, `2024-12-25T00:00:00Z`.\n"
"\n"
"**Opcionales:**\n"
"`--channel`: canal donde publicarlo (por defecto el actual).\n"
"`--emoji`: emoji personalizado.\n"
"`--winners`: número de ganadores.\n"
"`--description`: descripción del embed.\n"
"`--hosted-by`: cambiar quién organiza."

#: giveaways.py:655
msgid "Page 1/3 — {clean_prefix}gw explain"
msgstr "Página 1/3 — {clean_prefix}gw explain"

#: giveaways.py:658
msgid "Giveaway Advanced — Restrictions & Styling"
msgstr "Sorteo avanzado — Restricciones y estilo"

#: giveaways.py:659
msgid ""
"**Restrictions:**\n"
"`--roles`: Restrict to specific roles.\n"
"`--blacklist`: Blacklisted roles.\n"
"`--joined`: Minimum days in server.\n"
"`--created`: Minimum account age in days.\n"
"`--cost`: Credit cost to enter.\n"
"`--bypass-roles`: Roles that bypass restrictions.\n"
"`--bypass-type`: `or` (any role) or `and` (all roles).\n"
"\n"
"**Multipliers:**\n"
"`--multiplier` / `-m`: Entry multiplier.\n"
"`--multi-roles` / `-mr`: Roles that receive the multiplier.\n"
"\n"
"**Styling:**\n"
"`--colour`: Embed color.\n"
"`--image`: Embed image URL.\n"
"`--thumbnail`: Embed thumbnail URL.\n"
"`--button-text`: Custom button text.\n"
"`--button-style`: `green`, `blurple`, `grey`, or `red`.\n"
"`--mentions`: Roles to @mention.\n"
"`--ateveryone` / `--athere`: Mention everyone/here."
msgstr ""
"**Restricciones:**\n"
"`--roles`: solo ciertos roles.\n"
"`--blacklist`: roles excluidos.\n"
"`--joined`: días mínimos en el servidor.\n"
"`--created`: antigüedad mínima de la cuenta en días.\n"
"`--cost`: créditos para participar.\n"
"`--bypass-roles`: roles que se saltan las restricciones.\n"
"`--bypass-type`: `or` (cualquier rol) o `and` (todos).\n"
"\n"
"**Multiplicadores:**\n"
"`--multiplier` / `-m`: multiplicador de participaciones.\n"
"`--multi-roles` / `-mr`: roles que reciben el multiplicador.\n"
"\n"
"**Estilo:**\n"
"`--colour`: color del embed.\n"
"`--image`: imagen del embed (URL).\n"
"`--thumbnail`: miniatura (URL).\n"
"`--button-text`: texto del botón.\n"
"`--button-style`: `green`, `blurple`, `grey` o `red`.\n"
"`--mentions`: roles a mencionar.\n"
"`--ateveryone` / `--athere`: mencionar a everyone/here."

#: giveaways.py:678
msgid "Page 2/3 — {clean_prefix}gw explain"
msgstr "Página 2/3 — {clean_prefix}gw explain"

#: giveaways.py:681
msgid "Giveaway Advanced — Toggles & Integrations"
msgstr "Sorteo avanzado — Interruptores e integraciones"

#: giveaways.py:682
msgid ""
"**Toggles:**\n"
"`--congratulate`: DM winners.\n"
"`--notify`: DM users who fail to enter.\n"
"`--multientry`: Allow multiple entries.\n"
"`--announce`: Post a separate end message.\n"
"`--show-requirements`: Show requirements in embed.\n"
"`--update-button`: Update button with entrant count.\n"
"\n"
"**3rd Party Integrations:**\n"
"`--level-req`: Red Leveler level.\n"
"`--rep-req`: Red Leveler rep.\n"
"`--tatsu-level` / `--tatsu-rep`: Tatsumaki.\n"
"`--mee6-level`: MEE6 level.\n"
"`--amari-level` / `--amari-weekly-xp`: Amari.\n"
"\n"
"**Examples:**\n"
"`{clean_prefix}gw adv --prize Nitro --duration 1h30m --winners 2 --congratulate`\n"
"`{clean_prefix}gw adv --prize VIP Role --end tomorrow at 6pm --roles @Members --cost 500`"
msgstr ""
"**Interruptores:**\n"
"`--congratulate`: MD a los ganadores.\n"
"`--notify`: MD a quien no pueda participar.\n"
"`--multientry`: permitir varias participaciones.\n"
"`--announce`: mensaje aparte al terminar.\n"
"`--show-requirements`: mostrar requisitos en el embed.\n"
"`--update-button`: mostrar participantes en el botón.\n"
"\n"
"**Integraciones de terceros:**\n"
"`--level-req`: nivel de Red Leveler.\n"
"`--rep-req`: reputación de Red Leveler.\n"
"`--tatsu-level` / `--tatsu-rep`: Tatsumaki.\n"
"`--mee6-level`: nivel de MEE6.\n"
"`--amari-level` / `--amari-weekly-xp`: Amari.\n"
"\n"
"**Ejemplos:**\n"
"`{clean_prefix}gw adv --prize Nitro --duration 1h30m --winners 2 --congratulate`\n"
"`{clean_prefix}gw adv --prize VIP Role --end tomorrow at 6pm --roles @Members --cost 500`"

