#: giveaways.py:1214
msgid "📖 Full guide for the Giveaway system."
msgstr "📖 Guía completa del sistema de sorteos."

#: giveaways.py:1217
msgid "🎉 Page {current}/{total} — Giveaways v{version}"
msgstr "🎉 Página {current}/{total} — Sorteos v{version}"

#: giveaways.py:1221
msgid "📖 Guide — Getting Started"
msgstr "📖 Guía — Primeros pasos"

#: giveaways.py:1222
msgid ""
"Welcome to the **Giveaway System**! 🎉\n"
"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n"
"\n"
"**Quick Start:**\n"
"Use `{p}gw start #channel 1h Prize Name` to create a simple giveaway.\n"
"\n"
"**Interactive Creation:**\n"
"Use `/gw create` (slash command) to create a giveaway with a form.\n"
"\n"
"**Advanced Giveaways:**\n"
"Use `{p}gw advanced` with flags for full customization: role restrictions, multipliers, costs, descriptions, custom embeds, and more.\n"
"\n"
"**How it works:**\n"
"Users click the button on the giveaway message to enter. When time is up, winners are drawn automatically and announced."
msgstr ""
"¡Bienvenido al **sistema de sorteos**! 🎉\n"
"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n"
"\n"
"**Inicio rápido:**\n"
"Usa `{p}gw start #canal 1h Premio` para crear un sorteo simple.\n"
"\n"
"**Creación interactiva:**\n"
"Usa `/gw create` (slash) para crear un sorteo con un formulario.\n"
"\n"
"**Sorteos avanzados:**\n"
"Usa `{p}gw advanced` con opciones para personalizarlo todo: roles, multiplicadores, costes, descripciones, embeds personalizados y más.\n"
"\n"
"**Cómo funciona:**\n"
"Los usuarios pulsan el botón del sorteo para participar. Al acabar el tiempo se eligen y anuncian los ganadores automáticamente."

#: giveaways.py:1241
msgid "⚙️ Guide — Features"
msgstr "⚙️ Guía — Funciones"

#: giveaways.py:1242
msgid ""
"The giveaway system includes many powerful features:\n"
"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n"
"\n"
"🔒 **Role Restrictions** — Limit who can enter by roles.\n"
"\n"
"🚫 **Blacklists** — Block specific roles from entering.\n"
"\n"
"✖️ **Multipliers** — Give specific roles extra entries.\n"
"\n"
"💰 **Entry Cost** — Charge credits to enter.\n"
"\n"
"📅 **Account Age** — Minimum account/server age.\n"
"\n"
"👥 **Multiple Winners** — Draw more than one winner.\n"
"\n"
"🔄 **Rerolls** — Reroll ended giveaways if needed.\n"
"\n"
"🎨 **Customizable** — Colors, images, emojis, button styles.\n"
"\n"
"📨 **DM Notifications** — Notify winners and failed entries.\n"
"\n"
"🔗 **3rd Party** — MEE6, Tatsu, Amari, Leveler integrations."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de sorteos incluye muchas funciones:\n"
"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n"
"\n"
"🔒 **Restricción por roles** — limita quién puede participar.\n"
"\n"
"🚫 **Exclusiones** — impide participar a ciertos roles.\n"
"\n"
"✖️ **Multiplicadores** — da participaciones extra a ciertos roles.\n"
"\n"
"💰 **Coste de entrada** — cobra créditos por participar.\n"
"\n"
"📅 **Antigüedad** — antigüedad mínima de la cuenta o en el servidor.\n"
"\n"
"👥 **Varios ganadores** — sortea más de un ganador.\n"
"\n"
"🔄 **Repetir** — repite el sorteo de uno terminado.\n"
"\n"
"🎨 **Personalizable** — colores, imágenes, emojis, estilos de botón.\n"
"\n"
"📨 **Avisos por MD** — avisa a ganadores y a quien no pueda participar.\n"
"\n"
"🔗 **Terceros** — integración con MEE6, Tatsu, Amari y Leveler."

#: giveaways.py:1261
msgid "🛠️ Guide — Defaults & Presets"
msgstr "🛠️ Guía — Valores por defecto y plantillas"

#: giveaways.py:1262
msgid ""
"Customize defaults and save reusable templates:\n"
"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n"
"\n"
"**Server Defaults:**\n"
"Configure default settings that apply to all new giveaways.\n"
"`{p}gw set show` — View current defaults\n"
"`{p}gw set updatebutton true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set congratulate true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set notify true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set showrequirements true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set announce true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set emoji 🎁`\n"
"`{p}gw set buttontext Join Now!`\n"
"`{p}gw set buttonstyle blurple`\n"
"\n"
"**Presets (Templates):**\n"
"Save commonly used flag combinations.\n"
"`{p}gw preset save weekly --winners 3 --congratulate --roles @Members`\n"
"`{p}gw preset use weekly --prize Nitro --duration 7d`\n"
"`{p}gw preset list` — View all presets\n"
"`{p}gw preset delete weekly`"
msgstr ""
"Personaliza los valores por defecto y guarda plantillas:\n"
"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n"
"\n"
"**Valores por defecto del servidor:**\n"
"Se aplican a todos los sorteos nuevos.\n"
"`{p}gw set show` — ver los valores actuales\n"
"`{p}gw set updatebutton true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set congratulate true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set notify true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set showrequirements true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set announce true/false`\n"
"`{p}gw set emoji 🎁`\n"
"`{p}gw set buttontext ¡Participa!`\n"
"`{p}gw set buttonstyle blurple`\n"
"\n"
"**Plantillas:**\n"
"Guarda combinaciones de opciones que uses a menudo.\n"
"`{p}gw preset save weekly --winners 3 --congratulate --roles @Members`\n"
"`{p}gw preset use weekly --prize Nitro --duration 7d`\n"
"`{p}gw preset list` — ver todas\n"
"`{p}gw preset delete weekly`"

#: giveaways.py:1288
msgid "📋 Guide — Managing Giveaways"
msgstr "📋 Guía — Gestionar sorteos"

#: giveaways.py:1289
msgid ""
"Commands for managing active and ended giveaways:\n"
"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n"
"\n"
"**While Active:**\n"
"`{p}gw list` — List all active giveaways\n"
"`{p}gw info <id>` — View giveaway details\n"
"`{p}gw entrants <id>` — List all participants\n"
"`{p}gw edit <id> [flags]` — Edit an active giveaway\n"
"`{p}gw end <id>` — End and draw winners now\n"
"`{p}gw cancel <id>` — Cancel without drawing\n"
"\n"
"**After Ended:**\n"
"`{p}gw reroll <id>` — Reroll winners\n"
"`{p}gw info <id>` — View ended giveaway info\n"
"`{p}gw entrants <id>` — View entrants of ended giveaway\n"
"`{p}gw history` — View recent giveaway history\n"
"\n"
"**Maintenance:**\n"
"`{p}gw cleanup` — Remove all ended giveaways from config\n"
"`{p}gw delete <id>` — Delete a specific ended giveaway"
msgstr ""
"Comandos para gestionar sorteos activos y terminados:\n"
"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n"
"\n"
"**Mientras están activos:**\n"
"`{p}gw list` — sorteos activos\n"
"`{p}gw info <id>` — detalles\n"
"`{p}gw entrants <id>` — participantes\n"
"`{p}gw edit <id> [opciones]` — editar\n"
"`{p}gw end <id>` — terminar y sortear ya\n"
"`{p}gw cancel <id>` — cancelar sin sortear\n"
"\n"
"**Cuando han terminado:**\n"
"`{p}gw reroll <id>` — repetir ganadores\n"
"`{p}gw info <id>` — información\n"
"`{p}gw entrants <id>` — participantes\n"
"`{p}gw history` — historial reciente\n"
"\n"
"**Mantenimiento:**\n"
"`{p}gw cleanup` — borrar los sorteos terminados\n"
"`{p}gw delete <id>` — borrar un sorteo terminado"

